#: /Users/mingyuanw/Desktop/Project/Keydion/templates/FAQ.html:181
msgid "faq_q1"
msgstr "Q. Can I directly use essays from Keydion commercially?"

#: /Users/mingyuanw/Desktop/Project/Keydion/templates/FAQ.html:183
msgid "faq_a1"
msgstr ""
"A. No. Only with the permission from the original author can one "
"commercially use essays from Keydion. Keydion does not grant users the "
"rights directly."

#: /Users/mingyuanw/Desktop/Project/Keydion/templates/FAQ.html:189
msgid "faq_q2"
msgstr "Q. I am not from a school currently running Keydion. Can I submit?"

#: /Users/mingyuanw/Desktop/Project/Keydion/templates/FAQ.html:191
msgid "faq_a2"
msgstr ""
"A. Yes. Keydion is open to all schools and feel free to submit your essays "
"to make a contribution to the academia and gain more attentions from others."

#: /Users/mingyuanw/Desktop/Project/Keydion/templates/FAQ.html:197
msgid "faq_q3"
msgstr "Q. I want to join or collaborate with Keydion, how can I?"

#: /Users/mingyuanw/Desktop/Project/Keydion/templates/FAQ.html:199
msgid "faq_a3"
msgstr ""
"A. We always welcome either students or institutions to collaborate or join "
"with us. Please contact us with the info given in the bottom of the main "
"page."

#: /Users/mingyuanw/Desktop/Project/Keydion/templates/FAQ.html:205
msgid "faq_q4"
msgstr "Q. My essay appeared in Keydion without permission, what shall I do?"

#: /Users/mingyuanw/Desktop/Project/Keydion/templates/FAQ.html:207
msgid "faq_a4"
msgstr ""
"A. Keydion absolutely prioritizes your rights. Please contact us ASAP with "
"the info given in the bottom of the main page. We will try our best to "
"provide assistance."

#: /Users/mingyuanw/Desktop/Project/Keydion/templates/FAQ.html:213
msgid "faq_q5"
msgstr "Q. I found an issue of Keydion, what can I do?"

#: /Users/mingyuanw/Desktop/Project/Keydion/templates/FAQ.html:215
msgid "faq_a5"
msgstr ""
"A. You may contact us with the info given in the bottom of the main page. "
"Awards may be given."

